  "scope": "Three strictly serial rotations with analytic removal of two known vacuum ports.\nThe physical output has four ports. All samplers that accept two active ports\nuse that reduction and pad zeros back; Frugal retains its four-port-only ABI.\nThis avoids the expensive upstream v2 traversal of empty high-photon prefixes.\nOne-thread resource comparisons and separate16-thread throughput. All include\nmodel/core preparation, sampling, count-to-click conversion and destruction.\nImports and DLL loading are excluded for every method. Repetitions deliberately\nreplay fixed control records, never contribute additional quality N.\n"
